#==============================================================================================
#
#   shadow_painting - Painting::ShadowPainting: box shadows and text shadows
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Painting/ShadowPainting.cpp (lines 1-151): the outer and inner
#       box shadow commands of each shadow layer (back to front, clipped to the outside or the
#       inside of the border radii), and the text shadow command of each layer of a fragment
#       span (its glyph run sliced to the span).
#
